A plus a second plus follows hands the quote its next block

```
> q
+
+
tail
.
<blockquote>
  <p>q</p>
  <p>tail</p>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > q
> +
> +
> tail
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <p>q</p>
    <p>tail</p>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> q
+
+
.
<blockquote>
  <p>q</p>
  <p>+</p>
</blockquote>
```
